WEBVTT

00:00:05.212 --> 00:00:07.171
- We're done runnin' away.
- Yeah.

00:00:07.256 --> 00:00:08.381
- Yeah.
- Yep.

00:00:09.216 --> 00:00:11.175
Chief, do what you need to do.

00:00:11.260 --> 00:00:12.510
What?

00:00:12.595 --> 00:00:15.346
Y... You're turning yourself in?

00:00:15.431 --> 00:00:19.851
We might not have stolen the meteorite,
but we did steal a lot of other things.

00:00:19.935 --> 00:00:22.270
It's time we took some responsibility.

00:00:22.354 --> 00:00:24.230
Start a clean state.

00:00:25.899 --> 00:00:26.899
Take us in, Chief.

00:00:28.068 --> 00:00:29.235
Wow, really?

00:00:29.903 --> 00:00:30.903
You finally did it.

00:00:30.988 --> 00:00:33.531
This is your moment, Chief. Drink it in.

00:00:33.616 --> 00:00:36.701
[gasps] Wow!
You know, I should give a speech.

00:00:36.785 --> 00:00:38.369
Well, I should, shouldn't I?

00:00:38.454 --> 00:00:39.579
- Uh...
- [Chief clears throat]

00:00:39.663 --> 00:00:40.872
When I was six years old,

00:00:40.956 --> 00:00:42.832
I decided that
I wanted to play the piccolo,

00:00:42.916 --> 00:00:45.627
only to find that my fingers
were just too powerful

00:00:45.711 --> 00:00:47.587
for that fragile little instrument.

00:00:47.671 --> 00:00:50.590
And that's when I discovered
law enforcement.

00:00:50.674 --> 00:00:51.841
[chuckles]

00:00:51.925 --> 00:00:53.676
I'm proud of you, Wolf.

00:00:53.761 --> 00:00:56.929
You know,
a fox and a wolf are not that different.

00:00:57.514 --> 00:00:59.223
You got a good thing
goin' here, Governor.

00:00:59.308 --> 00:01:02.352
So, it turns out the saga of the Bad Guys
has come to

00:01:02.436 --> 00:01:05.146
<i>a simple and totally satisfying</i>
<i>conclusion.</i>

00:01:05.230 --> 00:01:07.857
<i>Though, I wonder,</i>
<i>what happened to the meteorite?</i>

00:01:07.941 --> 00:01:09.692
<i>[Marmalade] Cuddles! Faster, faster!</i>

00:01:09.777 --> 00:01:11.402
[Tiffany Fluffit]
<i>It's Professor Marmalade!</i>

00:01:11.487 --> 00:01:13.363
<i>He's bringing the meteorite back!</i>

00:01:13.447 --> 00:01:14.447
<i>Huh?</i>

00:01:15.115 --> 00:01:16.616
<i>Uh, yes. Yes.</i>

00:01:16.700 --> 00:01:18.076
<i>Bringing it back.</i>

00:01:18.160 --> 00:01:19.744
That's precisely what I am doing.

00:01:23.957 --> 00:01:25.583
Look no further.

00:01:25.668 --> 00:01:27.835
Your hero has arrived.

00:01:27.920 --> 00:01:29.253
Professor, care to comment?

00:01:29.338 --> 00:01:31.339
I tried to help them, Tiffany.

00:01:31.423 --> 00:01:33.966
But in the end,
it's the same old story.

00:01:34.051 --> 00:01:36.844
Bad guys, bad.
Good guys, good.

00:01:36.929 --> 00:01:38.554
So true. So wise.

00:01:38.639 --> 00:01:40.306
Furthermore, for the good of the city,

00:01:40.391 --> 00:01:43.142
I have generously decided
to take the meteorite back

00:01:43.227 --> 00:01:45.520
to my compound for safekeeping.

00:01:45.604 --> 00:01:48.690
- [crowd cheering]
- Is he seriously gonna get away with this?

00:01:48.774 --> 00:01:51.651
Thank you.
Gosh, you're kind.

00:01:51.735 --> 00:01:53.277
Give it up for me!

00:01:53.362 --> 00:01:54.862
[Chief] Wait a second.

00:01:54.947 --> 00:01:56.698
This isn't the meteorite!

00:01:56.782 --> 00:01:58.157
- It's a lamp!
- [Marmalade gasps]

00:01:58.242 --> 00:02:00.159
- [all] Huh?
- [laughing]

00:02:00.244 --> 00:02:01.244
[all] What?

00:02:01.745 --> 00:02:03.746
<i>[Tarantula] Snake, what did you just do?</i>

00:02:03.831 --> 00:02:06.499
<i>[Snake] What? My friend was sad,</i>
<i>and I was just cheerin' him up.</i>

00:02:06.583 --> 00:02:08.376
<i>[Tarantula] I think Wolf was right.</i>

00:02:08.460 --> 00:02:11.170
<i>Maybe we could be</i>
<i>more than just scary villains.</i>

00:02:14.508 --> 00:02:16.259
I'm bad, you're bad.

00:02:16.343 --> 00:02:17.635
Let's be bad together.

00:02:17.720 --> 00:02:19.595
You've got yourself a deal.

00:02:21.515 --> 00:02:24.308
- Can I try it on?
- Of course, partner.

00:02:39.908 --> 00:02:42.118
- [Snake gasps]
- Don't mind us, just robbin' this place.

00:02:46.415 --> 00:02:47.832
No, no, no!

00:02:52.296 --> 00:02:55.006
- But if that's a lamp, where is the...
- [Snake laughing]

00:02:55.090 --> 00:02:56.466
The old switcheroo.

00:02:57.885 --> 00:02:59.177
[clicks]

00:03:13.734 --> 00:03:15.485
[police radio chatter]

00:03:16.904 --> 00:03:17.904
[engine starts]

00:03:17.988 --> 00:03:18.988
[purring]

00:03:21.825 --> 00:03:23.826
[siren wailing]

00:03:26.121 --> 00:03:27.872
It's a butt.

00:03:29.958 --> 00:03:31.793
[whistling]

00:03:35.047 --> 00:03:36.047
Hold on.

00:03:36.131 --> 00:03:38.341
This is the Zumpango diamond!

00:03:38.425 --> 00:03:41.844
But this was stolen by the...
[gasps]

00:03:41.929 --> 00:03:44.263
By the Crimson Paw!

00:03:44.348 --> 00:03:45.765
- Me? No, no, no.
- [crowd murmuring]

00:03:45.849 --> 00:03:47.809
OMG.

00:03:47.893 --> 00:03:49.769
- And a shocking twist.
- You're making a huge mistake.

00:03:49.853 --> 00:03:53.272
The notorious bandit
known as the Crimson Paw

00:03:53.357 --> 00:03:56.984
has been revealed to be
none other than Professor Marmalade.

00:03:57.069 --> 00:03:58.528
[Marmalade] I'm not the Crimson Paw.

00:03:58.612 --> 00:03:59.987
She's the Crimson Paw.

00:04:00.072 --> 00:04:01.322
She's the Paw!

00:04:01.406 --> 00:04:03.491
I'm a flower of goodness! No!

00:04:03.575 --> 00:04:05.993
Whoo! That's my reptile, right there.

00:04:06.078 --> 00:04:07.662
- That's what I'm talkin' about.
- Yeah!

00:04:07.746 --> 00:04:10.414
Come on, somebody had to
destroy that meteorite.

00:04:10.499 --> 00:04:11.874
That thing was dangerous.

00:04:11.959 --> 00:04:14.126
That was pretty good there, Snakey.

00:04:14.211 --> 00:04:16.128
Good? It was genius.

00:04:16.213 --> 00:04:18.047
Not only did I foil the pig,

00:04:18.131 --> 00:04:21.133
I got you to admit
how much you care about me.

00:04:21.218 --> 00:04:22.218
Sure, yeah.

00:04:22.302 --> 00:04:24.011
I just wonder about one little thing.

00:04:24.096 --> 00:04:25.471
Oh, yeah? What's that, Wolf?

00:04:26.181 --> 00:04:29.308
Who do you think
put that one Push Pop in the fridge?

00:04:31.186 --> 00:04:32.270
Wait.

00:04:32.354 --> 00:04:33.479
You...

00:04:33.564 --> 00:04:35.565
- No.
- I knew you were good.

00:04:36.358 --> 00:04:37.567
No!

00:04:38.193 --> 00:04:39.610
We good, baby.

00:04:39.695 --> 00:04:40.903
- We good.
- Yeah!

00:04:41.572 --> 00:04:44.198
<i>♪ Feeling all right ♪</i>

00:04:44.283 --> 00:04:45.575
<i>♪ Uh-huh ♪</i>

00:04:46.285 --> 00:04:49.704
<i>♪ I'm not feeling too good myself ♪</i>

00:04:49.788 --> 00:04:51.622
<i>♪ Uh-huh ♪</i>

00:04:52.249 --> 00:04:54.333
<i>♪ Yeah, you're feelin' all right ♪</i>

00:04:55.377 --> 00:04:56.711
<i>♪ Uh-huh ♪</i>

00:04:57.337 --> 00:05:00.590
<i>♪ I'm not feeling too good, little girl ♪</i>

00:05:00.674 --> 00:05:02.425
<i>♪ Uh-huh ♪</i>

00:05:04.303 --> 00:05:09.181
<i>♪ Seems I've got to have</i>
<i>A change of scene ♪</i>

00:05:10.058 --> 00:05:12.059
<i>♪ Every night I have ♪</i>

00:05:12.144 --> 00:05:14.103
<i>♪ The strangest dreams ♪</i>

00:05:15.314 --> 00:05:19.942
<i>♪ lmprisoned by the way</i>
<i>It could have been ♪</i>

00:05:21.361 --> 00:05:25.364
<i>♪ Left here on my own or so it seems ♪</i>

00:05:25.449 --> 00:05:26.657
[Wolf] Okay.

00:05:26.742 --> 00:05:28.367
So, imagine it's your birthday.

00:05:28.452 --> 00:05:30.453
- [Snake] it is my birthday.
- [Wolf] Yeah, I know.

00:05:30.537 --> 00:05:32.622
But we're walkin' along,
and you meet a genie.

00:05:32.706 --> 00:05:35.374
- [Snake] Okay. What's his name?
- What's the genie's name?

00:05:35.459 --> 00:05:36.918
Yeah, I wanna know
who I'm talkin' to.

00:05:37.002 --> 00:05:38.586
I don't know.
"Genie," or "Gene" for short.

00:05:38.670 --> 00:05:40.087
So he offers you three wishes.

00:05:40.172 --> 00:05:41.213
Why three?

00:05:41.298 --> 00:05:44.342
You know, industry standard.
Now, what do you wish for?

00:05:44.426 --> 00:05:45.760
- Uh...
- Good luck out there, guys.

00:05:45.844 --> 00:05:47.053
I'm gonna go with nothin'.

00:05:47.137 --> 00:05:48.262
Nothing?

00:05:48.347 --> 00:05:50.139
Come on, it's your birthday.

00:05:50.223 --> 00:05:52.350
All right!
But what do I need wishes for?

00:05:52.434 --> 00:05:53.768
I got my freedom.

00:05:53.852 --> 00:05:54.936
- Hey.
- Guys!

00:05:55.020 --> 00:05:56.312
Lookin' good, hermanos!

00:05:56.396 --> 00:05:57.730
- I got my friends.
<i>- Aw.</i>

00:05:57.814 --> 00:06:00.316
I've got the skin
of a reptile half my age.

00:06:00.400 --> 00:06:02.652
I don't know about "half your age,"
but you look good.

00:06:02.736 --> 00:06:03.986
Well,
that's because you just molted.

00:06:04.071 --> 00:06:05.154
Yes, I did.

00:06:05.238 --> 00:06:06.364
You smell good, too.

00:06:06.448 --> 00:06:08.324
I'm shiny, I'm gorgeous.

00:06:08.408 --> 00:06:10.993
[all laughing]

00:06:11.078 --> 00:06:12.078
[Wolf] Huh.

00:06:15.540 --> 00:06:16.749
[Tarantula] Um...

00:06:16.833 --> 00:06:18.668
So, what do we do now?

00:06:18.752 --> 00:06:20.544
- [Piranha] Steal a car?
- [Wolf] Piranha!

00:06:20.629 --> 00:06:22.296
I was joking.

00:06:22.381 --> 00:06:23.631
It was a joke!

00:06:23.715 --> 00:06:27.885
You know, on second thought, Wolf,
maybe I'd wish for a ride.

00:06:27.970 --> 00:06:30.054
[Wolf] Oh, yeah? Alakazam.

00:06:32.015 --> 00:06:33.140
Nice.

00:06:33.225 --> 00:06:35.267
Hey, guys.
Ready to get to work?

00:06:35.352 --> 00:06:36.352
[meows]

00:06:36.436 --> 00:06:38.062
Hey! Whoa!

00:06:40.983 --> 00:06:42.650
[engine revs]

00:06:42.734 --> 00:06:43.776
Hey, you.

00:06:43.860 --> 00:06:46.487
That's right, come here. A little closer.

00:06:46.571 --> 00:06:48.030
I said, "Closer."

00:06:48.740 --> 00:06:51.617
Now that we've had some time
to get acquainted, uh,

00:06:51.702 --> 00:06:54.245
not so scary now, are we?

00:06:54.329 --> 00:06:56.038
Webs, hit it.

00:06:56.123 --> 00:06:58.749
["Brand New Day" playing]

00:06:58.834 --> 00:07:00.126
[all laughing]

00:07:00.210 --> 00:07:02.420
[Piranha] Whoo-hoo!

